sequenceDiagram
    participant Users as 50,000 Users
    participant Cache as Redis
    participant DB as Database

    Note over Cache: Key product:hot expires at T=0
    
    rect rgb(255, 200, 200)
        Note over Users,DB: PROBLEM - Stampede
        Users->>Cache: GET product:hot (all simultaneous)
        Cache-->>Users: MISS (all)
        Users->>DB: 50,000 simultaneous queries
        Note over DB: 💥 Database overwhelmed
    end
    
    rect rgb(200, 255, 200)
        Note over Users,DB: SOLUTION - Mutex Lock
        Users->>Cache: GET product:hot
        Cache-->>Users: MISS
        Users->>Cache: SETNX lock:product:hot
        Note over Cache: Only User 1 gets lock
        Cache-->>Users: Lock acquired (User 1 only)
        Users->>DB: SELECT (only User 1)
        DB-->>Users: Data
        Users->>Cache: SET product:hot + DEL lock
        Note over Users: Other 49,999 retry GET
        Users->>Cache: GET product:hot
        Cache-->>Users: HIT
    end
